### Anything else?

This is a duplicate for a [58670](https://github.com/angular/angular/issues/58670) issue (which is now closed but the bug is still present), the 58670 has some live examples.

This issue seems to be related to "withI18nSupport" hydration option even though none of the elements has i18n properties on them.
